bugs i will not solve:
  ☐ rename a folder is bugged
    create a folder in the real c: and put a file inside it. open tablacus virtualized , go to c: and rename that folder, the folder will be renamed but the file will not copied. this happens in sandboxie too , so i will not fix it for now because if most of things work fine in sandboxie even with this bug,then things must work fine too with my tool too, but this merits a fix really, but it will not be a good fix because we will have to copy the real folder to the virtual store which means the usually quick rename operations will now take a lot of time (the time needed to copy the original folder) + the space ocupied by the new copied files (imagine big filder and a script rename 3 times that folder, we will end up with 3 big folders in the virtual store+the real dir), so there is no clean an beautifull solution, so if i fix it i must make it an optional fix using a flag to enable this fix when needed.
    the test for this bug is in _test13_mergewrites_full.bat section 11.4 and _test12_merged_writes.bat section 3.2
